  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Ivory Coast &#x2013;MHPSS Expert with ACF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of Action Contre la Faim&apos;s (ACF) commitment to strengthening mental health and psychosocial support services (MHPSS) in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, ACF seeks the Netherlands Enterprise Agency&apos;s (RVO) support for the deployment of an MHPSS expert. This expertise will be instrumental in facilitating the establishment and structuring of a dedicated MHPSS Technical Working Group (TWG), with ACF serving as the hosting organization.The objective of this initiative is to establish a coordination mechanism among key stakeholders, ensure better integration of MHPSS approaches within national public health and humanitarian policies, and support the development of standards and operating procedures tailored to the Ivorian context. Through this support, the project partners also aim to foster experience sharing, strengthen capacity-building efforts, and improve monitoring and evaluation mechanisms for MHPSS interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
